# This prototype is its own cargo workspace, so it has its own build directory.
# The repo-root .gitignore's bare `target` entry already covers it, but it is
# spelled out here so the fence is legible from inside the prototype.
#
# Cargo.lock is NOT ignored: this is a binary, and the whole value of a
# prototype is that someone can re-run it later and get the same build.
/target
